<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Plot twist: your face is on our flyer</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Add a photo, add your name, and make your whole feed jealous.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0px" />
      <mj-column padding="0px" />
      <mj-image padding="0px" />
      <mj-text color="#222222" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" padding="0 36px 16px 36px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #B83C27; }
      @media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {
        .hero div { font-size: 31px !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F5F5F5" width="600px">

    <mj-section padding="22px 0 10px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.5" color="#6B6B6B" align="center" padding="0 24px">ISF Forum 2026 &middot; Saturday 28 November &middot; ICC Ibadan</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0" padding="38px 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="1.5px" line-height="1" padding="0 30px 18px 30px"><span style="background:#D0442D;color:#FFFFFF;padding:7px 12px;display:inline-block;">I'M ATTENDING</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text css-class="hero" align="center" font-size="38px" font-weight="700" line-height="1.12" color="#141414" padding="0 28px 14px 28px">Your face. Our flyer.<br /><span style="color:#B83C27;">Your whole feed jealous.</span></mj-text>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" color="#555555" padding="0 40px 22px 40px">No design skills. No Canva. No asking a friend to resize it.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://theisfforum.com/flyer" background-color="#B83C27" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="17px" font-weight="700" border-radius="6px" inner-padding="16px 36px" align="center" padding="0 36px 28px 36px">Put my face on it</mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Flyer example -->
    <mj-section background-color="#EDEDED" padding="26px 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/d445e774325bbc10dd091c61a6784cb296f9525d/isf-2026/flyer-nov/flyer-example.jpg" width="330px" align="center" href="https://theisfforum.com/flyer" alt="Example attendee flyer: See you in Ibadan. I'm attending ISF Forum 2026, with the attendee's photo, name and role, Saturday 28 November 2026, International Conference Centre, Ibadan." />
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="14px" line-height="1.5" color="#555555" padding="14px 30px 22px 30px">Here is mine. It took about a minute.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="32px 0 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hi there,</mj-text>
        <mj-text>You registered for ISF Forum 2026. Excellent decision. The only thing missing now is proof. Here is how to get yours:</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- How to -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 36px 8px 36px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/d445e774325bbc10dd091c61a6784cb296f9525d/isf-2026/flyer-nov/flyer-how-to.png" width="520px" align="center" border-radius="6px" href="https://theisfforum.com/flyer" alt="How it works. Step 1: add your photo. Step 2: type your name and, if you like, your role or company. Step 3: tap Download my flyer, or Share flyer." />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Ask -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="14px 0 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>There is a suggested caption on the page too, so you do not have to stare at a blinking cursor. Then post it everywhere: LinkedIn, Instagram, WhatsApp status, the family group that never replies. Tag us on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/innovationandscaleforum" style="color:#B83C27;text-decoration:underline;">Instagram</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/isfforum" style="color:#B83C27;text-decoration:underline;">LinkedIn</a> so we can cheer you on.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://theisfforum.com/flyer" background-color="#B83C27" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" border-radius="6px" inner-padding="15px 34px" align="center" padding="4px 36px 22px 36px">Make my flyer</mj-button>
        <mj-text>P.S. Someone in your circle is still &ldquo;thinking about it&rdquo;. Seeing your flyer might be the nudge they need.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="6px 36px 30px 36px">See you in Ibadan,<br />David Adeleke<br /><span style="color:#6B6B6B;">Convener, ISF Forum 2026</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Black strip, echoing the flyer -->
    <mj-section background-color="#141414" padding="20px 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center" font-size="16px" line-height="1.5" color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 30px 12px 30px">Let's make the right connections.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- FIXED BOTTOM: Ibadan banner -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/isf-newsletter-assets/isf-2026/speakers-oct/isf-big-ideas-banner.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px" href="https://theisfforum.com/flyer" alt="ISF Forum 2026 banner showing the Ibadan skyline" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-section padding="22px 0 30px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">ISF Forum &middot; Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">You are receiving this email because you registered for ISF Forum 2026.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px"><a href="{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}" style="color:#666666;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
